OL,3,GNEWSAEverything we know about Oasis's
OL,4,Areturn to Knebworth
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter years of speculation, Oasis are
OL,7,Freturning to Knebworth House, the scene
OL,8,Fof their now-legendary 1996 concerts.
OL,10,FThey played to 250,000 people across
OL,11,Ftwo nights, but the shows have since
OL,12,Fbuilt a legacy far beyond those who
OL,13,Fwere there.
OL,15,FThat became clear to me earlier this
OL,16,Fyear on the Tokyo subway, nearly 6,000
OL,17,Fmiles (9,660km) away, where I saw a
OL,18,Fyoung Japanese fan wearing a T-shirt
OL,19,Ffeaturing Liam Gallagher and the words
OL,20,F"Oasis Knebworth 1996".
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
